        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "それは違うがな、もっとよく考えろよ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "何度も言ってるがな、今度はちゃんと覚えてくれよ。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "いやいや、そこは僕の席だがな。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "あの時、もう少し踏ん張ればよかったがな。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Gemini",
                "note": "gemini-2.5-flash"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": []
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 3,
        "gloss": "particle adding uncertainty",
        "register": "standard",
